  "runtimeEvidence": [
    "Real Linux Docker local tmpfs byte/inode ENOSPC, isolated native AgentLoop/ToolRuntime, keeper input copy and bounded stat/cat artifact export after worker removal.",
    "Actual Host HTTP canary, no Host bind mount/socket/environment, worker and keeper HostConfig inspection including fixed keeper 32 MiB / 16 PIDs and log driver none.",
    "Native cancellation, separate packaged CLI revoke, Host process-group SIGKILL with setsid descendant heartbeat; worker, keeper and volume absence are checked.",
    "Actual quota-volume deletion failure retains unknown reservation; next controller removes resources and releases ordinary cleanup occupancy without replay.",
    "Actual volume create followed by lost completion ACK remains unknown/nonquiescent; new Host recovery still retains occupancy despite current absence, and a later pool request is denied.",
    "Actual image commit adds VOLUME, which provisioning rejects; derived local test image and source container are removed. No image pull.",
    "Artifact broker rejects parent/final symlinks, hardlinks, directory/FIFO, per-file and aggregate byte excess and malformed UTF-8; model/owner/Policy identity in integration is a fixture, not a production external account."
  ],
